<h3><u>Ayaa Hai Alaam</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Alamdaar na aaya (5)</p>

<p>Aaya hai alam aur alamdaar na aaya</p>

<p>Daryaa se dil e hyder e karraar na aaya.</p>

<p>Aaya hai....</p>

<p>1) baazuu Jo katey daanto mey mashkeeza dabaaya (2)<br />
Jab mashq chidii Phir WO hayaadaar na aaya.<br />
Aaya hai....</p>

<p>2) har laash pey Bhaii ka madadgaar tha GAAZI (2)<br />
Baad uskey koi shah ka madadgaar na aaya.<br />
Aaya hai.....</p>

<p>3) jab tak WO rahaa chaadar e zainab ka muhaafiz (2)<br />
Qaimey ki taraf koi sitamgaar na aaya.<br />
Aaya hai.....</p>

<p>4) baazuu tha Jo Shabbir ka Bey baazu huwaa WO (2)<br />
Bey dast WO Dast e shah e abraar na aaya.<br />
Aaya hai....</p>

<p>5) jis waqt tamaachey hai lagey Boli sakina (2)<br />
Kya mujhpey Chacha Jaan tumhey pyaar na aaya.<br />
Aaya hai....</p>

<p>6) hai mujhko yaqee naizey pey GAAZI ko ye ghum tha (2)<br />
Qabzey mey Merey shaam ka baazaar na aaya.<br />
Aaya hai.....</p>

<p>7) maangaa hai sakina key tawassul sey Jo mesum (2)<br />
Salmaan dar e GAAZI se inkaar na aaya.<br />
Aaya hai....</p>
</p>